From b0a0b7321e8975101fe73fcaec920839877a30c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammad <mohad2005m7@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:10:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(company): let a company control its supervisors

- DELETE /company/supervisors/{userId}: take a supervisor off the roster (204).
  409 Company.SupervisorLeadsGroups while they still lead one of the company's
  groups; the Supervisor role is removed when no roster has them any more.
- POST /company/supervisors/{userId}/disable | enable (204): CompanySupervisor
  gains IsSuspended (roster rows expose isSuspended, additive). A supervisor
  suspended on every roster gets 403 Supervisor.Suspended on login, verify,
  Google and refresh (checked in BuildAuthUserAsync); suspending revokes the
  supervisor's refresh tokens.
- POST /company/supervisors/{userId}/temp-password (200 { temporaryPassword }):
  replaces the password with a new temporary one, emails it, revokes sessions.
- Not on my roster -> 404 Company.SupervisorNotOnRoster.
- Migration AddSupervisorSuspension (IsSuspended bool, default false).
- Tests: domain (suspend/reactivate/remove rules) + integration (temp password
  replaces the old one, suspended supervisor blocked until reactivated, remove
  only after reassigning groups, role dropped). OpenAPI snapshot refreshed.

Non-breaking for Flutter: new endpoints and one additive field.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jr2Qm8EMVF7cfvmCiiJ7dx
